    <!-- 1. Description of Service -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">1. Description of Service</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        And God Said is a free web-based platform built to encourage daily Bible reading and Christian community. The service provides reading plans, daily email reminders, reading progress tracking, leaderboards, and group discussion capabilities.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. User Accounts -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">2. User Accounts & Registration</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        <li>You must provide an accurate and valid email address when creating an account.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your password and account security.</li>
        <li>You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use or security breach of your account.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Community Guidelines & Acceptable Use -->
