      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">3. Community Guidelines & Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        And God Said is designed to foster a positive, supportive, and uplifting community around God's Word. When posting comments, participating in groups, or sending messages:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        <li>Treat all participants with kindness, dignity, and respect.</li>
        <li>Do not post profane, harassing, hateful, discriminatory, or unlawful content.</li>
        <li>Do not post unsolicited commercial advertisements, spam, links to malicious software, or promotional material.</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to disrupt or compromise the technical infrastructure of the platform.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

