        <li><strong>KJV (King James Version):</strong> Public domain.</li>
        <li>Other translations are used in accordance with their respective copyright permissions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Disclaimer & Limitation of Liability -->
    <section class="space-y-3 bg-base-200/50 border border-base-300/80 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-serif text-neutral">5. Disclaimer & Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content/80">
        And God Said is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without warranties of any kind. While we strive to ensure uninterrupted service and reliable email delivery, we do not guarantee that the service will always be error-free or uninterrupted.
      </p>
